  "description": "meme-id: violence_is_never_the_answer; hasOverallIntent: Propaganda; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a person with a distressed or exasperated expression, holding their head, against a dark red background. The text \"violence is never the answer\" is overlaid. The overall intent is propagandistic, aiming to promote a moral or political message advocating for non-violent conflict resolution. The visual of the person in apparent distress serves as an emotional appeal to reinforce the textual message, suggesting that violence leads to suffering or negative outcomes. There is no evidence of toxicity such as abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or other targeted discrimination based on protected characteristics. The meme is intended to influence viewers toward a specific ethical stance, making it a form of propaganda.",
